  "fullDescription": "Rediscover the timeless beauty of a rustic garden with this stunning collection of 10 Pressed Flower Floral Junk Journal digital papers. Each design is a lovingly crafted, photorealistic masterpiece, celebrating the delicate art of pressed flowers. You’ll find intricate arrangements of dried daisies, clusters of fragrant lavender, and a beautiful assortment of blue and yellow wildflowers.\n\nThese beautiful botanicals are artfully composed to create natural floral borders and frames, surrounding a beautifully textured background that evokes the feel of aged parchment, handmade paper, or a sun-faded diary page. This collection is steeped in a rustic, vintage, and cottagecore aesthetic, with designs that intentionally leave ample blank space in the center. This makes them the perfect, ready-to-use canvas for your thoughts, memories, and creative expressions.\n\nThese papers are an absolute must-have for paper crafters and digital artists alike. They are specifically designed to be the perfect junk journal kit, providing instant, beautiful pages and signatures that look like you’ve been collecting and pressing flowers for years. Use them to create breathtaking scrapbook layouts for heritage photos, garden themes, or weddings. They are also ideal for digital planners as dashboards or divider pages, or for printing as physical ephemera for fussy cutting and layering.\n\nBut their use doesn’t stop there! Design one-of-a-kind wedding invitations with a rustic, farmhouse charm. Create beautiful greeting cards, decoupage projects, or unique backgrounds for POD products like journals, phone cases, mugs, and stationery.",
